s.\n- **Line 21 (`j = i + 1;`)**: Executable whenever `svp_simple_328_001_isr_2` runs.\n\nBoth operations are reachable and executable given the ISR triggers. Thus, potential atomicity violations exist due to concurrent modifications without synchronization.\n\n### Final Report\n```json\n{\n    \"violations\": [\n        {\n            \"sharedVariable\": \"i\",\n            \"accessPattern\": [\"Write\", \"Read\", \"Write\"],\n            \"lines\": [15, 21, 15]\n        },\n        {\n            \"sharedVariable\": \"j\",\n            \"accessPattern\": [\"Write\", \"Read\", \"Write\"],\n            \"lines\": [21, 15, 21]\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```\n\n[Expert R2] (Refine the report based on judge feedback, re-check for missed or false defects.)\n```json\n{\n    \"violations\": [\n        {\n            \"sharedVariable\": \"i\",\n            \"accessPattern\": [\"Write\", \"Read\", \"Write\"],\n            \"lines\": [15, 21, 15]\n        },\n        {\n            \"sharedVariable\": \"j\",\n            \"accessPattern\": [\"Write\", \"Read\", \"Write\"],\n            \"lines\": [21, 15, 21]\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```\n\n"
